		<RichText x="9" y="1053" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">正常</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="9" y="1113" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">虚弱</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1164" width="439" height="135" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">支援护罩·柔：<span color="#7fbfff">48水</span><span>盾，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s，</span><span>受</span><span color="#bfceff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，当护罩受到</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>/</span><span color="#99ffff">冰</span><span>元素伤害时，根据所受攻击的元素量，扣除</span><span color="#7fbfff">4水</span><span>(2单位以下)或</span><span color="#7fbfff">8水</span><span>(2单位及以上)，击破后三者虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>。<br/>支援护罩·刚：全体生命盾，继承狮獒自身</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30%</span><span>生命值，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s</span><span>，击破后三者虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>。<br/>若护罩超时未击破，那么所有成员都恢复</span><span color="#bfffbf">25%</span><span>生命值，同时提高</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>攻击力。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7维尔霍文斯基.assets/Image_16.png')" x="719" y="841">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7维尔霍文斯基.assets/Image_17.png')" x="721" y="1066">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7维尔霍文斯基.assets/Image_18.png')" x="720" y="1322">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="408" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">狮獒使用铲子铲起砂石，朝玩家扔来，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="409" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">狮獒使用十字镐敲击，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">65%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="413" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">狮獒使用铲子转身回旋，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害，随后摔倒。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="927" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">狮獒飞击，顺势进行十字斩，造成<span color="#7fbfff">80%</span><span>伤害，随后翻身。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1151" width="438" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">狮獒趴下并蓄力。随后使用镐和铲交替进行攻击，分别造成<span color="#7fbfff">65%,100%</span><span>伤害,重复4次后停下。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，狮獒每进行2段攻击，就会被打断，第三次被打断则直接击飞。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1407" width="438" height="172" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">进行「情谊佑助」时，负责维持<span textDecoration="underline">支援护罩·柔</span><span>。低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%</span><span>生命值时，其余2位兽众将加入战斗并保护狮獒，渠联展开</span><span textDecoration="underline">支援护罩·刚</span><span>并持续召唤下落水果攻击，长耳每</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3s</span><span>产生</span><span color="#bfffdf">排斥风场</span><span>。受保护时生命值不会低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
